cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it."
title: "Qwen Text-to-SQL Lab"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research repository for adapting Qwen3.5-4B to text-to-SQL with
  LoRA and QLoRA. The primary endpoint is execution accuracy: generated SQL is
  executed against the target SQLite database and compared with the result of the
  verified reference query. The repository provides schema-grounded data
  preparation from BIRD, database-disjoint splitting, adapter training,
  read-only execution evaluation, and paired bootstrap model comparison.
type: software
